### ========================================
### 0. Login first to get token
### ========================================
# @name studentLogin
POST http://localhost:5039/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "registrationNumber": "20240001",
    "pin": "1234"
}


### ========================================
### 1. Get My Profile
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:5039/api/students/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentLogin.response.body.$.token}}


### ========================================
### 2. Get My Dashboard
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:5039/api/students/me/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{studentLogin.response.body.$.token}}


### ========================================
### 3. Get Current Semester (anonymous)
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:5039/api/semesters/current


### ========================================
### 4. Try Without Token (expect 401)
### ========================================
GET http://localhost:5039/api/students/me